# 压缩能力探测样本：必须以真实扩展名入库（工具按内容识别，但探测流程依赖原文件名）
!agent/assets/archive-probes/*.zip
!agent/assets/archive-probes/*.tar
!agent/assets/archive-probes/*.tar.gz
!agent/assets/archive-probes/*.tar.bz2
!agent/assets/archive-probes/*.tar.xz
!agent/assets/archive-probes/*.tar.zst
!agent/assets/archive-probes/*.7z
!agent/assets/archive-probes/*.rar

